---
import ArrowLink from '../../components/ArrowLink.astro';
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
import FuzzBanner from '../../components/FuzzBanner.astro';
import FuzzEditor from '../../components/FuzzEditor.astro';
import PixelMixer from '../../components/PixelMixer.astro';
import LangToggle from '../../components/LangToggle.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Fuzz Pedal | Tools | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Fuzz Pedal: make retro 8-bit sound effects in your browser and download them as WAV." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<p class="back"><ArrowLink href="/tools/" back>All tools</ArrowLink></p>
			<FuzzBanner />
			<LangToggle />
			<FuzzEditor />
			<div class="placeholder">
				<h1 class="visually-hidden">Fuzz Pedal</h1>
				<p class="soon" data-zh="早期版本">Early version</p>
				<p class="note" data-zh="功能都能用了，界面还是初版。">Everything works; the look is still a first pass.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- About / credits, in the spirit of jsfxr's own about page. -->
			<footer class="about">
				<PixelMixer />
				<h2 data-zh="关于 Fuzz Pedal">about Fuzz Pedal</h2>
				<div data-lang-block="zh" class="zh-block">
					<p class="lede">
						Fuzz Pedal 是一个在线 8-bit 音效生成器，用来做复古游戏音效。只需要一个浏览器：选一个预设，推几下滑杆，就能下载 WAV
						放进你的游戏。它基于{' '}<a href="https://sfxr.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">jsfxr</a>，也就是 DrPetter 原版{' '}
						<a href="https://www.drpetter.se/project_sfxr.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sfxr</a> 的 JavaScript 移植版。
					</p>
					<p class="credits">
						（基于{' '}<a href="https://sfxr.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">jsfxr</a>，移植自 DrPetter 的{' '}
						<a href="https://www.drpetter.se/project_sfxr.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sfxr</a>）<br />
						jsfxr © 2011 Eric Fredricksen<br />
						Chris McCormick 参与贡献<br />
						Fuzz Pedal 界面 © 2026 Yuxin Guo
					</p>
					<p><a href="https://github.com/chr15m/jsfxr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">（jsfxr 源代码）</a></p>
					<p class="tip">小提示：导出 <code>.wav</code>，可以直接拖进 Unity、Godot 或 Unreal。</p>
				</div>
				<div data-lang-block="en">
				<p class="lede">
					Fuzz Pedal is an online 8-bit sound maker for retro game effects. All you need is a web browser:
					pick a preset, push the sliders, then download a WAV for your game. It is built on{' '}
					<a href="https://sfxr.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">jsfxr</a>, the JavaScript port of the original{' '}
					<a href="https://www.drpetter.se/project_sfxr.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sfxr</a> by DrPetter.
				</p>
				<p class="credits">
					(Based on{' '}<a href="https://sfxr.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">jsfxr</a>, a port of{' '}
					<a href="https://www.drpetter.se/project_sfxr.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sfxr</a> by DrPetter)<br />
					jsfxr © 2011 Eric Fredricksen<br />
					With contributions from Chris McCormick<br />
					Fuzz Pedal interface © 2026 Yuxin Guo
				</p>
				<p><a href="https://github.com/chr15m/jsfxr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">(jsfxr source code)</a></p>
				<p class="tip">Tip: export a <code>.wav</code> and drop it straight into Unity, Godot or Unreal.</p>
				</div>
			</footer>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
	/* 卓特悦动黑 ZT YueDongHei (SIL OFL 1.1, by 卓特视觉 / Droit Visual), shipped
	   unmodified. It is only requested once the page is switched to 中文, because
	   nothing uses the family before then. */
	@font-face {
		font-family: 'ZT YueDongHei';
		src: url('/fonts/zt-yuedonghei/ZT-YueDongHei.ttf') format('truetype');
		font-weight: 400 900;
		font-display: swap;
		/* CJK only, so Latin letters and digits still fall through to Google Sans Code */
		unicode-range: U+2014-201D, U+2026, U+3000-303F, U+4E00-9FFF, U+FF00-FFEF;
	}
	html[data-fuzz-lang='zh'] main,
	html[data-fuzz-lang='zh'] main * {
		font-family: 'ZT YueDongHei', var(--font-body), sans-serif !important;
	}
</style>

<style>
	main {
		width: 960px;
		padding-top: 2rem;
	}
	.back {
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
	}
	.placeholder {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 1.75rem 0 2rem;
		text-align: center;
	}
	/* The banner shows the title; keep a real heading for screen readers. */
	.visually-hidden {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.soon {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0.15rem 0.8rem;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: #f2b84b;
		background: rgba(239, 159, 39, 0.15);
		border: 1px solid rgba(239, 159, 39, 0.4);
		border-radius: 999px;
	}
	.note {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		font-size: 15px;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}

	/* EN / 中文: show the block that matches the switch (default English). */
	.zh-block {
		display: none;
	}
	:global(html[data-fuzz-lang='zh']) .zh-block {
		display: block;
	}
	:global(html[data-fuzz-lang='zh']) [data-lang-block='en'] {
		display: none;
	}

	/* About / credits footer. */
	.about {
		margin: 1rem auto 5rem;
		padding-top: 0.5rem;
		max-width: 760px;
		text-align: center;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	}
	.about h2 {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: 34px;
	}
	.about p {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}
	.about .credits {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}
	.about a {
		color: #ff7aa8;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.about a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
	.about .tip {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}
	.about code {
		padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem;
		font-size: 13px;
		background: var(--surface-raised);
		border-radius: 4px;
	}
</style>
